      "norm_label": "five-round breaker with controller adjudication at the cap",
      "rationale": "Past the cap, rounds don't converge \u2014 the failure is structural. The controller (which holds the plan and cross-task context the reviewer lacks) adjudicates each open finding only at the cap: park contestable/non-load-bearing findings with a ruling, STOP with BLOCKED on load-bearing ones. Adjudicating earlier is pre-judging with a different name; a silent discard is forbidden.",
